</head>
<body data-page="06A">
  <nav data-site-nav aria-label="dSpark 学习站导航"></nav>
  <main class="page page--wide">
    <header class="hero">
      <span class="topic-badge">06 的专题页 · 接受概率与 residual</span>
      <p class="eyebrow">06A · 拒绝采样修正实验室</p>
      <h1>拒绝之后不是取 argmax；而是从残差分布随机抽一个 token</h1>
      <p class="lead">下面把一次 draft=A 的拒绝拆成可手算的五步。多个 token 有正 residual 概率，只表示它们都可能被抽中；一次调用仍只返回一个 bonus。</p>
      <div class="evidence-strip"><span><strong>教学分布</strong> vocab={A,B,C,D}</span><span><strong>源码语义</strong> q 是当时真实 proposal 分布；p 是 Target 参数化后的分布</span><span><strong>边界</strong> 数值例用于解释算法，不是运行时 Tensor dump</span></div>
      <div class="route-switch" aria-label="选择讲解路线"><button type="button" data-route-choice="static-greedy">STATIC · 贪心</button><button type="button" data-route-choice="compact-sampling">COMPACT · 随机采样</button><button type="button" data-route-choice="folded-greedy">FOLDED · 贪心</button></div>
      <div data-semantic-legend></div>
    </header>
    <section class="handoff" aria-label="本页边界">
      <div class="handoff__item"><b>输入</b><span><code>q=[.50,.20,.20,.10]</code>、<code>p=[.20,.45,.25,.10]</code>、draft=A</span></div>
      <div class="handoff__item"><b>先判断</b><span>接受率 <code>min(1,p(A)/q(A))=.4</code>；本例 <code>u_accept=.70</code>，因此拒绝</span></div>
      <div class="handoff__item"><b>再修正</b><span><code>normalize(max(p-q,0))=[0,.8333,.1667,0]</code></span></div>
      <div class="handoff__item"><b>输出</b><span>默认 residual 随机数 <code>u=.90</code> 落到 C；Target argmax 则是 B</span></div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" id="rejection-lab">
      <div class="section__head"><p class="section__kicker">主视图 · 五步演算</p><h2>draft 多给 A 的概率被拒绝减掉，Target 多给 B/C 的概率由 residual 补回</h2></div>
      <div class="visual stepper" data-stepper data-steps="5">
        <div class="visual__bar"><strong>q / p → 接受率 → 拒绝 → residual → 随机 bonus</strong><button class="zoom-button" type="button" data-zoom-target="#sampling-chain">放大主图</button></div>
        <div class="stepper__toolbar"><div class="stepper__buttons"><button type="button" data-step-action="prev">上一步</button><button type="button" data-step-action="next">下一步</button><button type="button" data-step-action="play">播放</button><button type="button" data-step-action="reset">重置</button></div><div class="stepper__progress"><span data-step-progress></span></div><div class="stepper__status" data-step-status></div></div>
        <div class="visual__body canvas-scroll"><div class="math-chain" id="sampling-chain" aria-label="拒绝采样修正五步图">
          <article class="math-node" data-step-node="0"><b>1 · 重建真实分布</b><code>q=softmax(corrected_logits/T_D)</code><code>p=Target(T,top_k,top_p)</code><span>没有真实 q，就无法精确修正。</span></article>
          <article class="math-node" data-kind="guard" data-step-node="1"><b>2 · A 的接受率</b><code>min(1,.20/.50)=.40</code><span><code>u_accept=.70 &gt; .40</code>，本例拒绝 A。</span></article>
          <article class="math-node" data-kind="fail" data-step-node="2"><b>3 · 减去 Draft 多给的质量</b><code>max(p-q,0)</code><code>=[0,.25,.05,0]</code><span>A 的多余概率不会再进入 bonus。</span></article>
          <article class="math-node" data-kind="data" data-step-node="3"><b>4 · 归一化 residual</b><code>[0,.8333,.1667,0]</code><span>B、C 均有正概率；总和为 1。</span></article>
          <article class="math-node" data-kind="main" data-step-node="4"><b>5 · 随机返回一个 bonus</b><code>u=.90 → C</code><span>p 的 argmax 是 B，但本次 residual draw 是 C。</span></article>
        </div></div>
        <div class="visual__bar"><strong>三组概率条 · 长度直接对应概率质量</strong></div>
        <div class="visual__body canvas-scroll"><div class="dist-lab">
          <article class="dist-card" data-step-node="0"><h3>Draft proposal q</h3><div class="mini-bar"><b>A</b><i style="--p:50%"></i><span>.50</span></div><div class="mini-bar"><b>B</b><i style="--p:20%"></i><span>.20</span></div><div class="mini-bar"><b>C</b><i style="--p:20%"></i><span>.20</span></div><div class="mini-bar"><b>D</b><i style="--p:10%"></i><span>.10</span></div></article>
          <article class="dist-card" data-kind="main" data-step-node="0"><h3>Target p · argmax=B</h3><div class="mini-bar"><b>A</b><i style="--p:20%"></i><span>.20</span></div><div class="mini-bar"><b>B</b><i style="--p:45%"></i><span>.45</span></div><div class="mini-bar"><b>C</b><i style="--p:25%"></i><span>.25</span></div><div class="mini-bar"><b>D</b><i style="--p:10%"></i><span>.10</span></div></article>
          <article class="dist-card" data-kind="guard" data-step-node="3"><h3>拒绝后的 residual</h3><div class="mini-bar"><b>A</b><i style="--p:0%"></i><span>0</span></div><div class="mini-bar"><b>B</b><i style="--p:83.33%"></i><span>.8333</span></div><div class="mini-bar"><b>C</b><i style="--p:16.67%"></i><span>.1667</span></div><div class="mini-bar"><b>D</b><i style="--p:0%"></i><span>0</span></div></article>
        </div></div>
        <div class="visual__bar"><strong>Residual CDF · 拖动随机数观察只返回一个 token</strong></div>
        <div class="visual__body" data-step-node="4">
          <div class="cdf" aria-label="Residual 累积分布：B 占 0 到 0.8333，C 占 0.8333 到 1"><div class="cdf__b">B · [0,.8333)</div><div class="cdf__c">C · [.8333,1]</div><span class="cdf__marker" data-cdf-marker></span></div>
          <label class="sample-control"><span><b>residual 随机数 u</b><br><input type="range" min="0" max="1" value="0.90" step="0.01" data-residual-u></span><output class="sample-result" data-sample-result>u=.90 → bonus=C</output></label>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" id="boundaries">
      <div class="section__head"><p class="section__kicker">辅助视图 · 三种语义</p><h2>greedy、sampling、mixed 不要互相套用结论</h2></div>
      <div class="compare-grid">
        <article class="compare-card" data-routes="static-greedy folded-greedy"><b>greedy</b><span>Draft 与 Target 都是点质量；首个 mismatch 后，bonus 就是该边界的 Target argmax，不需要概率修正。</span></article>
        <article class="compare-card" data-routes="compact-sampling"><b>sampling</b><span>逐步按 p/q 接受；首次拒绝时从 residual 随机选一个。多个 token 可选不等于同时接受多个。</span></article>
        <article class="compare-card"><b>mixed batch</b><span>同批先得到 greedy 与 sampling 两套结果，再由 <code>greedy_mask[req]</code> 逐请求选用。</span></article>
      </div>
      <details class="source-details"><summary>为什么 / 易错边界 / 源码锚点</summary><div class="source-details__body">
        <div class="callouts"><div class="callout" data-kind="fail"><b>为什么拒绝后不能继续用后置 Target 行</b><p>后置行的 causal context 已包含被拒绝的 draft token；它不再对应最后已接受前缀。</p></div><div class="callout" data-kind="guard"><b>全接受时的 bonus</b><p>若所有 draft 都通过，最后一个 token 直接从 Target p 的终点分布随机采样；仍不是强制 argmax。</p></div></div>
        <div class="source-anchor"><code>python/sglang/kernels/ops/speculative/dspark/dspark_accept.py:80–174</code><span>构造 Target p、调用 chain rejection sampling，并按接受索引取得随机 predicts/bonus。</span></div>
        <div class="source-anchor"><code>python/sglang/kernels/ops/speculative/reject_sampling.py:48–160</code><span><code>u*q(d)&lt;p(d)</code> 的接受测试与首次拒绝后的归一化 <code>max(p-q,0)</code> 采样。</span></div>
        <div class="source-anchor"><code>python/sglang/srt/speculative/dspark_components/dspark_verify.py:679–722</code><span>由 <code>corrected_logits/temperature</code> 重建 proposal q，并处理 sampling/mixed 分派。</span></div>
      </div></details>
    </section>
    <nav class="pager" aria-label="相邻章节"><a data-nav href="dspark-accept-finalize.html">← 06 · 接受 / 收尾</a><a data-nav href="dspark-target-hidden-kv-explainer.html">07 · 隐藏状态 / Draft KV / 滚动锚点 →</a></nav>
    <footer class="site-footer">专题边界 · 数值例用于解释当前源码实现的精确分布修正；未执行 GPU kernel 运行时采样。</footer>
  </main>
  <script>
    addEventListener("DOMContentLoaded",()=>{const input=document.querySelector("[data-residual-u]");const marker=document.querySelector("[data-cdf-marker]");const output=document.querySelector("[data-sample-result]");if(!input||!marker||!output)return;const render=()=>{const u=Number(input.value);const token=u<.8333?"B":"C";marker.style.left=`${u*100}%`;output.textContent=`u=${u.toFixed(2)} → bonus=${token}`};input.addEventListener("input",render);render()});
  </script>
</body>
</html>
